        "hypothesis": "A single static per-column worksharing loop can reduce synchronization overhead across the statistics pipeline, while fusing the arithmetic and harmonic mean traversals avoids a second input pass without changing either accumulation order. Combining these with bounded four-thread execution and the linear mode scan may improve full-program time; the controller should measure the combined effect.",
        "id": "f32ab21de9074b1f",
        "ordinal": 2,
        "parent_id": null,
